<p><strong>Page type</strong>: New SCP idea<br />
So my SCP is a man in a hot air balloon that is designated safe as he doesn't attack anything. The Hot-Air balloon itself can reach up to extremely fast speeds and stop on a time and do things such as move in any direction or things like barrel rolls. A real physics breaking type entity. For example, the Balloon can easily reach Mach 3 and then stop instantly with no inertia, no drag, nothing and the man in said balloon doesn't fly out of the balloon or do any type of bracing for the oncoming stop. The SCP itself can initiate maneuvers such as barrel rolls.</p>
<p>From what I read I have to get the concept greenlight then the draft and then the final green light for it to become and &quot;Canon&quot; article.</p>

