														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4853909">
									

<p>I'm not a woman and I am fairly offended at this&#8230; so I would worry about anyone who identifies as female and how they might feel. Echoing all of the concerns mentioned above&#8230; I would also like to point out that the horrible misogyny angle of common horror tropes is not only offensive, it's boring.</p>
<p>Try to aim for something not meant to shock&#8230; because often times when we try to shock, we aim too low and end up writing offensive things&#8230; or more often, just boring things.</p>
<p>Think about something that makes you uneasy, and write an article about that, in a grounded contemplative way.</p>
<p>I would hope you are going to go back to the drawing board, but I just wanted to urge you to think about how others might respond to your proposal for the next idea.</p>

