<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>Twist is surrounded in what he calls a “LLUN” aura, which gives Twist his anomalous nature and various abilities and is what prevents Twist from speaking certain truths.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>Sorry to be blunt, but what does this mean? I kept thinking it would get unpacked in one of the other sections but it doesn't.</em></p>
<p>Moreover, I don't see a connection between this aspect, the &quot;deep secret&quot; and the whole vaccine thing&#8230; Feels like a few thin ideas sorta slammed together without connective tissue.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>James Devillian Twist will instantly uncover this kind of information simply by looking at these creatures. Twist will instantly know various bits of information about a target within his line of sight such as the target's purpose(supposed destiny), function, how it works, and how to eliminate it.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>I assume this is from the <strong>Aura</strong> but that isn't any better connected to these other factors I mentioned above. I think you need to sit down and simplify, make a cohesive anomaly about the one man and focus on his anomalous aspects that thematically connect to each other.</em></p>
<hr /></div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Mostly I think this person's anomalous abilities aren't super interesting (knowing someone's destiny? What does that mean?) but primarily you need to make these different concepts work together or snip some of them.</p>
<p>My suggestion would be to cut the &quot;vaccine&quot; bit as it sounds a little too like <a href="/scp-049">SCP-049</a> without much to differentiate it.</p>

